  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Gender Budgeting in Ukraine 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering Gender Budgeting Ukraina 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Kiev har genomf&#xf6;rt ett avrop fr&#xe5;n Sidas ramavtal f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingstj&#xe4;nster. Uppdragets syfte &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera resultaten av projektet &#x201d;Gender Budgeting in Ukraine&#x201d; som Sverige st&#xf6;dde under 2013-2020. Utv&#xe4;rderingens &#xf6;vergripande &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att ge ambassaden och dess partner underlag f&#xf6;r kommande diskussioner om f&#xf6;rberedelser av ett fortsatt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsbudgetreform i Ukraina samt underlag f&#xf6;r ambassadens  strategiska programmering inom Sveriges n&#xe4;sta strategi f&#xf6;r reformsamarbete med &#xd6;steuropa 2021-2027.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Kyiv has conducted a call off from Sida framework agreement for evaluation services. The purpose of the assignment is to evaluate the results of the &#x201c;Gender Budgeting in Ukraine&#x201d; project that Sweden supported during 2013-2020. The overarching purpose the evaluation is to provide the Embassy and its partners with an input to upcoming discussions concerning the preparation of a continued support to gender budgeting reform in Ukraine as well as strategic programming by the Embassy during Sweden&#xb4;s next strategy for reform cooperation with Eastern Europe 2021-2027.</narrative>
  </description>
